@api = http://localhost:8080

### Status da API
GET {{api}}/api/status

### Lista caminhões, com cargas e cálculos
GET {{api}}/api/trucks

### Cria caminhão (toco do exemplo resolvido)
POST {{api}}/api/trucks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Toco",
  "plate": "ABC1D23",
  "lengthCm": 700,
  "widthCm": 250,
  "heightCm": 260,
  "maxLoadKg": 6000
}

### Adiciona carga ao caminhão 1 (200 caixas de 60 x 40 x 50 cm, 15 kg cada)
POST {{api}}/api/trucks/1/cargo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Caixas",
  "lengthCm": 60,
  "widthCm": 40,
  "heightCm": 50,
  "weightKg": 15,
  "quantity": 200
}

### Lista motoristas
GET {{api}}/api/drivers

### Cria motorista
POST {{api}}/api/drivers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "João Silva" }

### Coloca o motorista 1 no caminhão 1 (null tira o motorista)
PUT {{api}}/api/trucks/1/driver
Content-Type: application/json

{ "driverId": 1 }
